# Run by every login shell, after /conf/bshrc and ~/.bshrc.
# Starts BDeskUI where there is a graphics mode. Logging out of BDeskUI logs out
# here too. "to TTY" in its menu, no graphics mode, or autostart=no in your
# ~/.bdeskui.conf (Settings: start at login) leave you at this prompt instead.
bdeskui --autostart && logout
